stringToShow="The switches ahead can only be hit with Physical Attacks or Techs.#Spells will not work on them.#They must also all be hit at roughly the same time or they will deactivate.#If the barrier close by is blue, it will forever be gone once you#hit all the switches. If it is red, the barrier will return once#you leave the map."
